==Trivia==
*The word ''pichipichi'' (ピチピチ) in Fresh Wharf's Japanese name, Pichipichi Ryōba (ピチピチ漁場, "Lively Fishery") is an onomatopoeia for being lively or active, jumping around, or splattering.

